NOTE: These data represent the preliminary results of the 2008 Census of Population of DPRK which was 
conducted on 1-15 October 2008. They are based on manual tallies of the number of enumerated 
households and population. These figures may differ from the final results which will be based on the 
computerized data processing of the census. The 2008 Census of Population was conducted by the 
government of DPRK with financial and technical assistance from UNFPA. 

